{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Demo is out now. Try it now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;City in Flames: Rebel forces have overthrown the city, and you are the sole surviving agent. Survive relentless hordes of enemies, defeat monstrous bosses, and end the chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FireBurningCity</strong> is a thrilling blend of turn-based tactical combat and Vampire Survivors-like gameplay. Strategize with grid movement and skill-based attacks, enjoy satisfying map-clearing action through simple yet deep tactics, survive as long as possible, and take down the final powerful BOSS to clear the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/d11d1c35454432b91415f3c561d4e4cc.avif?t=1774069828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras_big/d11d1c35454432b91415f3c561d4e4cc.avif?t=1774069828 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based + Survivor-Like</strong>: A fresh hybrid of strategic planning and relentless survival action. Easy to learn, hard to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Skills, 2 Combat Styles</strong>, and screen-clearing ultimate abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Attributes </strong> to mix, match, and build your ultimate agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Levels, 2 Difficulty Modes</strong>: Face meticulously designed enemy waves and escalating challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Upgrades</strong>: Grow stronger even after defeat through meta-progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Unique Bosses</strong>: Face mind-bendin